OL,3,GNEWSAPolice issue warning after courier
OL,4,Afraud reports
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeicestershire Police is urging people
OL,7,Fto "remain vigilant" after it received
OL,8,Fseveral recent reports of courier
OL,9,Ffraud.
OL,11,FThe force said it was investigating
OL,12,Fseven reports of courier fraud - where
OL,13,Fcold callers claim to be a police
OL,14,Fofficer or a member of staff from their
OL,15,Fbank - in Leicester, Leicestershire and
OL,16,FRutland between 4 September and Monday.
OL,18,FNicole McIntyre, from the Economic
OL,19,FCrime Unit, said: "Fraudsters will
OL,20,Fusually target elderly or vulnerable
OL,21,Fpeople and often sound genuine to gain
OL,22,Fthe trust of the victim.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
